      Pass no `actions`: `ShareGif` and `{actions}` stay after it, as today, so the 1v1 toolbar still holds exactly seven buttons.
   5. In the header (`:3-4`), change "holds the controls in the board's notice slot" to "holds the controls (`ReplayToolbar.tsx`, which the co-op replay shares) in the board's notice slot". Make no other edits.

3. **`apps/web/src/duos/DuosReplay.tsx`**:
   1. Add `import { ReplayToolbar, isTyping } from "../replay/ReplayToolbar.tsx";` after the `../replay/download.ts` import. Keep `replayTestid, useBoardBusy` from `../replay/ReplayPlayer.tsx`.
   2. Delete `:93-100` (the "As the replay player's…" comment and `isTyping`).
   3. Right after `goTo`, add:
